  "worked_solution": "The image of $[x]_{B}$ relative to the basis $B$ under the action of the linear transformation $T$ is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T(x)]_{B} & =[T]_{B}[x]_{B} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
